<title>INDIA: India's RBI maintains repo cut off at 3.6 percent.</title>
<headline>India's RBI maintains repo cut off at 3.6 percent.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of India (RBI) said it maintained the cut-off rate at 3.60 percent at a repo auction on Thursday.</p>
</text>
